{"4782260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phobopetra", "steam_appid": 4782260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Year is 1962.</strong> Arthur returns to his ancestral home, a place where the air is heavy with the scent of old paper and the echoes of the past. <strong>PHOPOBETRA </strong>is a focused <strong>first-person narrative experience</strong> that blends <strong>psychological thriller</strong> elements with deep <strong>environmental storytelling</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness of the corridors, Sarah’s voice remains—a haunting whisper that guides you through the silence. To find the truth, you must look beyond the visible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features for Mystery Fans:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Secrets:</strong> Use a unique <strong>light-based mechanic</strong> to reveal objects, writings, and memories hidden from the naked eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous 1960s Realism:</strong> A highly detailed <strong>mid-century modern</strong> environment, featuring authentic analog technology and a gritty, cinematic aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Immersion:</strong> Interact with the world through a <strong>full physics system</strong>. Every object has weight, and every interaction feels real, pulling you deeper into the manor’s cold embrace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Binaural Audio Design:</strong> Experience an unsettling soundscape where the crackle of a <strong>vintage radio</strong> and the creak of floorboards create an atmosphere of constant tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fragments of a broken life. <strong>Investigate</strong> the Phobopetra. Face the truth before the light erodes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Year is 1962.</strong> Arthur returns to his ancestral home, a place where the air is heavy with the scent of old paper and the echoes of the past. <strong>PHOPOBETRA </strong>is a focused <strong>first-person narrative experience</strong> that blends <strong>psychological thriller</strong> elements with deep <strong>environmental storytelling</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the darkness of the corridors, Sarah’s voice remains—a haunting whisper that guides you through the silence. To find the truth, you must look beyond the visible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features for Mystery Fans:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Secrets:</strong> Use a unique <strong>light-based mechanic</strong> to reveal objects, writings, and memories hidden from the naked eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meticulous 1960s Realism:</strong> A highly detailed <strong>mid-century modern</strong> environment, featuring authentic analog technology and a gritty, cinematic aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Immersion:</strong> Interact with the world through a <strong>full physics system</strong>. Every object has weight, and every interaction feels real, pulling you deeper into the manor’s cold embrace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Binaural Audio Design:</strong> Experience an unsettling soundscape where the crackle of a <strong>vintage radio</strong> and the creak of floorboards create an atmosphere of constant tension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fragments of a broken life. <strong>Investigate</strong> the Phobopetra. Face the truth before the light erodes.</p>", "short_description": "A Soul, A Story, A Stone. 1962 Antarctica. An expedition unearths a stone that shatters reality. Trapped in a shifting 1960s estate, you must use its unnatural light to reveal hidden secrets. Time is bleeding away in this cinematic mystery. Can you escape before the heartbeat stops?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782260/21148e178bec080f9193570cad8a343465afd580/header.jpg?t=1787855577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782260/13ce883978fda9f559a0caa82edaf46d5acdec95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787855577", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4782260/13ce883978fda9f559a0caa82edaf46d5acdec95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787855577", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD is strongly recommended for seamless loading. Stereo headphones are essential to fully experience the immersive binaural audio voices.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700 / AMD Ryzen 7 3700X.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Addition